    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Healing 2 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Healing Citadel ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day 1 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer  \n\u0022The Empire have taken this realm from us. We must bring those responsible for the death of our Elf Lord to justice! However the Empire are just too strong to make a quick direct attack! We must choose a path to victory.\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Cyanidius ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Empire are a worthy foe! However on this day it is the Elven Alliance who are the victors. We shall use these supplies to further our conquest!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Fox City ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Fox city has fallen to the Elven Alliance! We must push onward and punish those who have murdered our Elf Lord!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Primera ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Legions Of The Damned are nearby. We must be on the alert at all times! We have done will with this victory!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squires 2 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Romulara ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Romulera ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We have a choice to make! Are we going to be at the beck and call of the Empire! Or are we going to coqnuer this realm for ourselves?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Fox City",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "We have captured an important city. We shall not lose this to our enemies. The Empire awaits our decision! Let us bide our time to our advantage!",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Cyandius City ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We are in the middle of both Citadel City and the Elves capital! If our foes attemt to attack us we must be prepared! Let us show our enemies the might of the Legions Of The Damned!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Citadel City area ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Angel \n\u0022Hold foul creature of the fiery depths! The Empire rule this realm! We ask for the Holy Artifact! Nothing else from you is of importance to us. Where is our artifact?\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Citadel City Elves",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Angel \n\u0022The Empire rule this realm not the Alliance! We make the decisions and it is up to you to follow our rules. We do not care who murdered your Elf Lord. All we care about is the Holy Artifact!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day 3 healing ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022During our struggles with the Empire we managed to defeat a number of their Mage Lords.The Mage Lords magic enriched the land and the water with healing spells. We must take advantage of these areas!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Healing ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S247SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S247EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arch-Devil \n\u0022The blood of the Empire\u0027s Mage Lords has been spilled. Their blood carried their magic. As the Mage Lords died their magics tried to desperately heal them. They failed, there are some areas where the spells reoccur healing everyone.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
